+
+Added `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service: returns the ids of equipment (of
+`kind`, or any kind when omitted) with no booking overlapping `[start, end)`, sorted. The period is
+validated like `quote`/`book`; an unknown `kind` throws. Tests added in `src/index.test.ts`.
